end="00:13.139">に</span><span begin="00:13.139" end="00:13.793">伝</span><span begin="00:13.793" end="00:14.174">え</span><span begin="00:14.174" end="00:14.957">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想告诉你</span></p><p begin="00:15.177" end="00:17.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:15.177" end="00:15.601">今日</span><span begin="00:15.601" end="00:16.278">こそ</span><span begin="00:16.278" end="00:16.625">は</span><span begin="00:16.625" end="00:17.003">言い</span><span begin="00:17.003" end="00:17.606">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天就想说出口来</span></p><p begin="00:17.606" end="00:20.355" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:17.606" end="00:18.763">マダマダマダ</span> <span begin="00:18.763" end="00:19.760">早い</span><span begin="00:19.760" end="00:20.099">か</span><span begin="00:20.099" end="00:20.355">な？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等等等等等等 会不会太早？</span></p><p begin="00:20.470" end="00:23.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:20.470" end="00:21.513">ノンノンノン</span> <span begin="00:21.513" end="00:21.811">大</span><span begin="00:21.811" end="00:22.897">丈夫</span><span begin="00:22.897" end="00:23.300">よ！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会不会不会 不要担心</span></p><p begin="00:23.555" end="00:26.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:23.555" end="00:24.174">憧</span><span begin="00:24.174" end="00:24.622">れの</span><span begin="00:24.622" end="00:25.272">先輩</span><span begin="00:25.272" end="00:25.753">カッ</span><span begin="00:25.753" end="00:26.055">プル</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟心中憧憬的前辈</span></p><p begin="00:26.371" end="00:28.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:26.371" end="00:26.744">み</span><span begin="00:26.744" end="00:27.072">たい</span><span begin="00:27.072" end="00:27.432">に</span><span begin="00:27.432" end="00:27.941">「一緒</span><span begin="00:27.941" end="00:28.211">に</span><span begin="00:28.211" end="00:28.507">帰</span><span begin="00:28.507" end="00:28.813">ろー♡」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同情侣般 “一起回家吧♡”</span></p><p begin="00:28.813" end="00:31.599" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:28.813" end="00:29.882">ヤダヤダヤダ</span> <span begin="00:29.882" end="00:30.871">勇気を</span><span begin="00:30.871" end="00:31.599">出して</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讨厌讨厌讨厌 鼓足勇气之后</span></p><p begin="00:31.633" end="00:34.198" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:31.633" end="00:32.641">ホドホドホド</span> <span begin="00:32.641" end="00:32.993">言っ</span><span begin="00:32.993" end="00:33.718">ちゃっ</span><span begin="00:33.718" end="00:34.198">た！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟随当下氛围 便说出了口来</span></p><p begin="00:34.716" end="00:45.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:34.716" end="00:39.724"><span begin="00:34.716" end="00:35.442">(ビックリ</span><span begin="00:35.442" end="00:35.777">させ</span><span begin="00:35.777" end="00:36.156">ちゃった</span><span begin="00:36.156" end="00:36.383">か</span><span begin="00:36.383" end="00:37.306">な？</span> <span begin="00:37.572" end="00:38.077">断</span><span begin="00:38.077" end="00:38.562">られ</span><span begin="00:38.562" end="00:38.938">ちゃう</span><span begin="00:38.938" end="00:39.330">か</span><span begin="00:39.330" end="00:39.724">な？)</span></span> <span begin="00:39.536" end="00:40.019">--- もう</span> <span begin="00:40.019" end="00:41.404">顔から</span><span begin="00:41.404" end="00:41.929">火が</span><span begin="00:41.929" end="00:42.096">吹</span><span begin="00:42.096" end="00:42.509">く</span> <span begin="00:42.629" end="00:42.989">胸</span><span begin="00:42.989" end="00:43.456">から</span><span begin="00:43.456" end="00:44.150">心臓が</span><span begin="00:44.150" end="00:44.718">飛び</span><span begin="00:44.718" end="00:45.288">出ちゃう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(这么突然会不会吓到你呢？</span></p><p begin="00:45.884" end="00:53.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:45.884" end="00:50.892"><span begin="00:45.884" end="00:46.610">(ビックリ</span><span begin="00:46.610" end="00:46.945">させ</span><span begin="00:46.945" end="00:47.324">ちゃった</span><span begin="00:47.324" end="00:47.551">か</span><span begin="00:47.551" end="00:48.474">な？</span> <span begin="00:48.740" end="00:49.245">断</span><span begin="00:49.245" end="00:49.730">られ</span><span begin="00:49.730" end="00:50.106">ちゃう</span><span begin="00:50.106" end="00:50.498">か</span><span begin="00:50.498" end="00:50.892">な？)</span></span> <span begin="00:51.069" end="00:51.323">--- ねぇ</span><span begin="00:51.323" end="00:51.840">早く</span><span begin="00:51.840" end="00:52.616">お願い</span><span begin="00:52.616" end="00:53.235">ナントカ</span><span begin="00:53.235" end="00:53.521">言っ</span><span begin="00:53.521" end="00:53.869">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(这么突然会不会吓到你呢？</span></p><p begin="00:54.081" end="00:56.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:54.081" end="00:54.607">時間が</span><span begin="00:54.607" end="00:55.361">止まってる</span><span begin="00:55.361" end="00:55.999">耐えられ</span><span begin="00:55.999" end="00:56.300">ない</span><span begin="00:56.300" end="00:56.678">って！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时间静止在这一刻</span></p><p begin="00:56.678" end="00:59.465" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:56.678" end="00:57.734">Woo</span> <span begin="00:57.734" end="00:58.161">スロー</span><span begin="00:58.161" end="00:58.825">モーション</span><span begin="00:58.825" end="00:59.182">モー</span><span begin="00:59.182" end="00:59.465">メント</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一刻一切都如慢动作回放般</span></p><p begin="00:59.562" end="01:06.499" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:59.562" end="01:00.466">Woo</span> <span begin="01:00.466" end="01:01.077">君の</span><span begin="01:01.077" end="01:01.575">答え</span><span begin="01:01.575" end="01:01.951">嘘</span><span begin="01:01.951" end="01:02.312">でしょ？</span><span begin="01:02.312" end="01:03.837">ホント？</span><span begin="01:04.680" end="01:05.675">「帰</span><span begin="01:05.675" end="01:06.499">ろう！」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的回答是玩笑？还是真心？</span></p><p begin="01:06.797" end="01:11.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:06.797" end="01:07.229">超</span><span begin="01:07.229" end="01:07.544">恋</span><span begin="01:07.544" end="01:07.909">して</span><span begin="01:07.909" end="01:08.552">る</span> <span begin="01:09.276" end="01:09.986">究極</span><span begin="01:09.986" end="01:10.317">愛</span><span begin="01:10.317" end="01:10.692">して</span><span begin="01:10.692" end="01:11.345">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超级喜欢你 爱你爱到极致</span></p><p begin="01:11.670" end="01:13.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:11.670" end="01:12.080">もう</span><span begin="01:12.080" end="01:12.598">ICE</span> <span begin="01:12.598" end="01:13.344">LIMIT</span><span begin="01:13.344" end="01:13.480">ま</span><span begin="01:13.480" end="01:13.937">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经快要企及冰限 5 4 3 2 1</span></p><p begin="01:14.096" end="01:17.363" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:14.096" end="01:14.901">5・</span><span begin="01:14.901" end="01:15.571">4・</span><span begin="01:15.571" end="01:16.265">3・</span><span begin="01:16.265" end="01:16.964">2・</span><span begin="01:16.964" end="01:17.363">1</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">5・4・3・2・1</span></p><p begin="01:17.614" end="01:18.963" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:17.614" end="01:17.990">溶け</span><span begin="01:17.990" end="01:18.342">ちゃう</span> <span begin="01:18.342" end="01:18.683">溶け</span><span begin="01:18.683" end="01:18.963">ちゃう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就要融化了 就要融化了</span></p><p begin="01:18.990" end="01:24.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:18.990" end="01:19.758">見上</span><span begin="01:19.758" end="01:20.457">げる</span><span begin="01:20.457" end="01:21.793">あなたの</span><span begin="01:21.793" end="01:22.951">笑顔</span><span begin="01:23.089" end="01:23.230">と</span><span begin="01:23.230" end="01:24.430">夕日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夕阳下的你仰望天空露出笑容</span></p><p begin="01:24.630" end="01:30.795" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:24.630" end="01:25.286">頬</span><span begin="01:25.286" end="01:25.667">が</span><span begin="01:25.667" end="01:26.374">赤</span><span begin="01:26.374" end="01:27.059">いの</span><span begin="01:27.059" end="01:27.923">バレ</span><span begin="01:27.923" end="01:28.125">な</span><span begin="01:28.125" end="01:28.784">きゃ</span><span begin="01:28.784" end="01:30.129">良い</span><span begin="01:30.129" end="01:30.795">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你不要发现我通红的脸颊</span></p><p begin="01:36.108" end="01:38.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:36.108" end="01:36.460">肩</span><span begin="01:36.460" end="01:37.794">ならべて</span><span begin="01:37.794" end="01:38.202">アイス</span><span begin="01:38.202" end="01:38.625">カップ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肩并肩吃着冰淇淋杯</span></p><p begin="01:38.942" end="01:41.241" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:38.942" end="01:39.289">食べ</span><span begin="01:39.289" end="01:40.297">ながら</span><span begin="01:40.297" end="01:40.644">待つ</span><span begin="01:40.644" end="01:40.963">バス</span><span begin="01:40.963" end="01:41.241">ストップ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耐心地在公交站等着车来</span></p><p begin="01:41.374" end="01:44.141" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:41.374" end="01:42.478">ネバネバネバ</span> <span begin="01:42.478" end="01:43.409">コレは</span><span begin="01:43.409" end="01:44.141">夢？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">简直前所未有 这是梦吗？</span></p><p begin="01:44.177" end="01:46.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:44.177" end="01:45.281">エバエバエバ</span> <span begin="01:45.281" end="01:45.942">ホッペ</span><span begin="01:46.113" end="01:46.582">つねっ</span><span begin="01:46.582" end="01:46.998">て！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望永远如此 伸手掐了掐脸颊</span></p><p begin="01:47.287" end="01:55.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:47.287" end="01:52.420"><span begin="01:47.287" end="01:47.650">(いま</span><span begin="01:47.650" end="01:48.407">君は</span><span begin="01:48.407" end="01:49.651">何を？</span> <span begin="01:50.119" end="01:50.658">考</span><span begin="01:50.658" end="01:51.087">えてる</span><span begin="01:51.087" end="01:51.495">の</span><span begin="01:51.495" end="01:52.420">かな？)</span></span> <span begin="01:52.481" end="01:53.065">--- クラス</span><span begin="01:53.065" end="01:53.588">メイト</span><span begin="01:53.588" end="01:53.926">との</span><span begin="01:53.926" end="01:54.465">話し</span><span begin="01:54.465" end="01:54.617">じゃ</span><span begin="01:54.617" end="01:54.945">無く</span><span begin="01:54.945" end="01:55.333">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(此时此刻的你到底在想些什么？)</span></p><p begin="01:55.423" end="01:58.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:55.423" end="01:55.978">あなたの</span><span begin="01:55.978" end="01:56.420">事</span><span begin="01:56.420" end="01:56.746">もっと</span><span begin="01:56.746" end="01:57.084">もっと</span><span begin="01:57.084" end="01:57.756">知りたい</span><span begin="01:57.756" end="01:58.054">の！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">关于你的事情</span></p><p begin="01:58.078" end="02:00.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:58.078" end="01:59.134">Woo</span> <span begin="01:59.134" end="01:59.561">スロー</span><span begin="01:59.561" end="02:00.225">モーション</span><span begin="02:00.225" end="02:00.582">モー</span><span begin="02:00.582"